From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000003 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: husky-port CI <ci@husky-port.local>
Date: Tue, 4 Nov 2026 20:15:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] gki_defconfig: disable CFI_CLANG (zuma module corruption
 test)

CFI failure in exynos_usbdrd_s2mpu_manual_control with a bogus
cross-module function pointer (random exported-symbol target per build).
.ko relocations/symbols verified byte-identical to LOS prebuilt kernel's
modules -> runtime loader-side corruption. Disabling CFI tests whether
CFI jump-table fixup writes are stomping module .data.

---
 arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig
index 052f7835d9c6..555555555555 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig
@@ -774,2 +774,3 @@
 # CONFIG_KUNIT_DEFAULT_ENABLED is not set
 # CONFIG_RUNTIME_TESTING_MENU is not set
+# CONFIG_CFI_CLANG is not set
